<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Munzo</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Munzo was the site of the royal court established by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kalala-ilunga">Kalala Ilunga</a>, the founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/luba-empire">Luba Empire</a>. According to the Luba profile, from Munzo he expanded Luba territory in several directions. It is associated with the foundational period of the empire's <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sacred-kingship">sacred kingship</a>.</p></div>
